OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATributes paid to 'inspirational'
OL,4,Apresenter and campaigner Esther Rantzen
OL,5,
OL,6,FDame Esther, who died on Wednesday at
OL,7,Fthe age of 86, was known for presenting
OL,8,FBBC consumer show That's Life! for 21
OL,9,Fyears, and for campaigning on issues
OL,10,Fincluding child welfare and assisted
OL,11,Fdying.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham led the
OL,14,Ftributes, saying the veteran
OL,15,Fbroadcaster had "changed countless
OL,16,Flives".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
