OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors is back - here's
OL,4,Awhat you need to know ahead of the
OL,5,Afirst show
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Celebrity Traitors is back for a
OL,8,Fsecond series, and viewers will see the
OL,9,Flikes of Michael Sheen, Jerry Hall,
OL,10,FRichard E Grant and Amol Rajan at the
OL,11,Fround table along with Bella Ramsey,
OL,12,FLeigh-Anne Pinnock, Maya Jama and King
OL,13,FKenny.
OL,15,FThere are 21 celebrities taking part in
OL,16,Ftotal - two more than last year - and
OL,17,Fthere will be an extra episode after
OL,18,Fthe huge popularity of the previous
OL,19,Fseries.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
