OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors is back - here's
OL,4,Awhat you need to know ahead of the
OL,5,Afirst show
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe extended 75-minute debut episode
OL,8,Fstarts at 20:00 BST on Thursday, with
OL,9,FClaudia Winkleman again hosting the
OL,10,Fmurderous game.
OL,12,FViewers can expect some fresh ideas,
OL,13,Fand executive producer Sarah Fay said
OL,14,Fthey "always want to push the envelope"
OL,15,Fwith the show's elaborate tasks.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
